    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Layer 1 — Local fast-fail",
      "items": [
        ".husky/pre-push roda pnpm ci:preflight antes do git push",
        "BLOQUEIA push se drift detectado — poupa ~4min round-trip CI",
        "Idempotente: roda em qualquer branch, exit 1 se algum check falhar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Layer 2 — Preflight CI (~10s)",
      "items": [
        "preflight job (independent): mesmas checks mas no GitHub Actions",
        "Detecta cross-refs quebradas, tsconfig drift, ESLint config legada",
        "Falha rápido antes do quality job consumir runner-time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Layer 3 — Quality gated",
      "items": [
        "needs: preflight — só roda se Camada 2 passou",
        "lint+typecheck+test:coverage (gate-enforced)+test:unit",
        "apps/api integration+e2e via testcontainers (Postgres:16-alpine)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Layer 3B — Docker smoke",
      "items": [
        "docker-build-prod job roda SÓ em pull_request (não em push)",
        "Builda apps/api + apps/web Dockerfile com --target prod",
        "Defesa contra bugs latentes tipo COPY path relativo"
      ]
    }
